    "sentence_translations": [
      "British students also have to memorize the multiplication table",
      "",
      "“One one is one... Nine nine eighty-one”. This is the multiplication table Chinese primary school students must memorize.",
      "“One one is one” means “1 times 1 equals 1”, “Nine nine eighty-one” means “9 times 9 equals 81”.",
      "Now British primary school students also have to memorize the multiplication table.",
      "",
      "British people think mathematics is very important, and therefore this year created a new regulation:",
      "Primary school students not only have to memorize the multiplication table up to 12x12, but also have to take a test on the multiplication table."
